---
/**
 * FOLLOW UP BOSS PIXEL — the site's only lead-delivery mechanism.
 * ============================================================================
 * Tracker ID: WT-FBRKNWTI
 *
 * With form capture enabled (Follow Up Boss → Pixel → Tracking) this script
 * reads form submissions straight off the page, creates the person record,
 * runs lead-flow rules and starts action plans. It detects name, email, phone
 * and message automatically, which is why src/scripts/leads.ts keeps hidden
 * `name` and `message` inputs current as the visitor types.
 *
 * ─── REMAINING SETUP STEP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Enable FORM CAPTURE under Pixel → Tracking. Without it this tracks visits
 * but creates no leads.
 *
 * ─── DO NOT ALSO ENABLE EMAIL PARSING ──────────────────────────────────────
 * The account's lead address (origin.admin@followupboss.me) is deliberately
 * NOT wired up. Follow Up Boss's guidance is to use exactly one ingestion
 * method; running the Pixel and email parsing together creates a duplicate
 * person for every submission. The address is kept in FOLLOW-UP-BOSS.md as the
 * documented fallback, not as a second live path.
 *
 * ─── NO API KEY ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * This snippet is public by design. A Follow Up Boss API key is not, and must
 * never appear in this project — scripts/check-env.mjs blocks the build if one
 * is found in a PUBLIC_* variable.
 */
---

{/* begin Widget Tracker Code */}
<script is:inline>
  (function (w, i, d, g, e, t) {
    w['WidgetTrackerObject'] = g;
    (w[g] =
      w[g] ||
      function () {
        (w[g].q = w[g].q || []).push(arguments);
      }),
      (w[g].ds = 1 * new Date());
    (e = 'script'), (t = d.createElement(e)), (e = d.getElementsByTagName(e)[0]);
    t.async = 1;
    t.src = i;
    e.parentNode.insertBefore(t, e);
  })(window, 'https://widgetbe.com/agent', document, 'widgetTracker');
  window.widgetTracker('create', 'WT-FBRKNWTI');
  window.widgetTracker('send', 'pageview');
</script>
{/* end Widget Tracker Code */}
